#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:5
msgid "AMDGPU Asynchronous Operations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:11
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUAsyncOperations.rst:13
msgid ""
"Asynchronous operations are memory transfers (usually between the global "
"memory and LDS) that are completed independently at an unspecified scope. A "
"thread that requests one or more asynchronous transfers can use *async "
"marks* to track their completion. The thread waits for each mark to be "
"*completed*, which indicates that requests initiated in program order before "
"this mark have also completed."
msgstr ""

